  "body": "## What changed\n\nAGENTS.md Issue Law: work in two lanes of two issues each - two bugs and two enhancements in flight at once (user request). A slot is held from the claim until the PR merges. The bug lane keeps the P0 → P1 → P2 → oldest order; the enhancement lane takes user-filed issues first, then P1 → P2 → oldest, so older enhancements are no longer starved by fresh bugs.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
